From c00f122b25acdf356235086b0d25ad54db86e6bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Reyyzzz24 <revayuliansatria@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 14:17:27 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 02/25] chore(deps): add Tailwind 3.4 + Radix UI packages for
 shadcn/ui

tailwindcss, tailwindcss-animate, class-variance-authority, clsx,
tailwind-merge, lucide-react, and Radix primitives (slot, dialog,
dropdown-menu, label, avatar, tooltip, tabs, checkbox, scroll-area,
separator). No React 19 peer conflicts introduced by these additions.
